<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS3" title="In 4.3 Results ‣ 4 Evaluation ‣ Beyond Subtokens: A Rich Character Embedding forLow-resource and Morphologically Complex Languages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.3.3 </span>Stylistic Device Detection</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS4" title="In 4.3 Results ‣ 4 Evaluation ‣ Beyond Subtokens: A Rich Character Embedding forLow-resource and Morphologically Complex Languages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.3.4 </span>BERT-like Model</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
