<span id="S3.T1.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:227.6pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">[BEG] (beginning of a word), [END] (end of a word), [UNK] (unknown character), [PAD] (padding token at the end of a word)</span>
</span></td></tr>
